    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27839" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mandēla</span></b> , ae,
		f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				town in the Sabine territory, near the Digentia</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 18,
